# Code

## Layout (Next.js App Router)
`src/app` routes · route colocation `app/*/_components` `app/*/_lib`
shared UI `src/components` · data/i18n/utils `src/lib`
import `@/*` · Lab nav SSOT `app/lab/_lib/routes.ts` · Lab shell `LabPageShell`
SSOT: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`

## Component
- `const` FC, no `React.FC`
- `interface` props: required first, optional `?` last
- no `any`, strict TS
- `"use client"` only if hooks/interaction

## Style
Tailwind `brand-*` from `globals.css` @theme

## Lab render
| page | mode |
| SSR/SSG/ISR | Server Component default |
| Charts/3D | `dynamic(ssr: false)` |
| CSR | `/api/metrics` + skeleton (placeholder if missing) |
| ISR | `export const revalidate = 60` |

## Done
`yarn` only · finish with `yarn verify` · no-console warn (scripts exempt)

